OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Zuckerberg to Irons - why do
OL,4,Athe wealthy buy Irish castles?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhy do rich people keep buying Irish
OL,7,Fcastles?
OL,9,FIt's a question that has cropped up
OL,10,Fonce again this week, following Meta
OL,11,FCEO Mark Zuckerberg's purchase of
OL,12,FStrancally Castle in County Waterford.
OL,14,FBut the Facebook founder is far from
OL,15,Fthe first - the likes of Jeremy Irons,
OL,16,FChristy Cashman, and the billionaire
OL,17,FJohn Malone have all bought Irish
OL,18,Fcastles in recent decades.
OL,20,FSo what exactly is going on?
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
